        "main_text_has_explicit_synthesis": true,
        "si_used": false,
        "procedure": "1–3 were solvothermally synthesized under autogenous pressure. [Fe3O(PhCO2)6(H2O)3](PhCO2) (0.1 mmol) and Ln(NO3)3·9H2O (0.1 mmol; Ln = Sm for 1) were added to 9 mL MeCN, stirred for 5 min, transferred to a 25 mL Teflon-lined autoclave, and heated at 140 °C for 2 days. After cooling to room temperature, pure orange crystals were collected, washed twice with 5 mL CH3CN, and dried under vacuum.",
